00:13:15,934 --> 00:13:20,011
Well in that case I'm compiling stats
from the future plans questionnaires.

258
00:13:20,094 --> 00:13:23,623
That's best if you don't ask
me to do stuff like statistics.

259
00:13:23,834 --> 00:13:26,094
Could you staple them for me? Nice.

260
00:13:26,334 --> 00:13:27,454
That I can do.

261
00:13:28,714 --> 00:13:32,631
Even though he knew it would be a pain,
he couldn't pretend not to notice.

262
00:13:32,714 --> 00:13:36,596
He's a person who will do things
for others when it really counts.

263
00:13:36,754 --> 00:13:40,519
Instead of being someone who just
does as they're told, like me.

264
00:13:43,654 --> 00:13:45,536
Honestly, he's always like this.

265
00:13:45,854 --> 00:13:46,734
So cute.

266
00:13:47,054 --> 00:13:47,934
I'm in love.

267
00:13:48,134 --> 00:13:49,193
Let's get married.

268
00:13:50,894 --> 00:13:54,174
Wait, what was that
reaction just now? Cute?

269
00:13:54,594 --> 00:13:57,634
I mean, I guess that's
acceptable, but marriage?

270
00:13:59,494 --> 00:14:00,714
Are you an idiot?

271
00:14:00,974 --> 00:14:02,171
It's too soon to get married.

272
00:14:02,254 --> 00:14:03,725
We haven't even dated yet

273
00:14:21,494 --> 00:14:22,324
Why?

274
00:14:22,407 --> 00:14:23,851
It's getting worse by the minute.

275
00:14:23,934 --> 00:14:25,711
My thoughts are filled with Tachibana.

276
00:14:25,794 --> 00:14:27,147
Is this the curse, too?

277
00:14:28,414 --> 00:14:29,244
Hey!

278
00:14:29,327 --> 00:14:30,157
You good, buddy?

279
00:14:31,894 --> 00:14:32,724
Tachibana!

280
00:14:32,807 --> 00:14:36,854
Right now, if I catch
even a glimpse, I might...

281
00:14:38,254 --> 00:14:40,054
Man, looks like it hurts.

282
00:14:40,494 --> 00:14:43,151
Cuts on the forehead really
bleed a ton, don't they?

283
00:14:43,234 --> 00:14:47,374
Tachibana, you're just so...

284
00:14:48,234 --> 00:14:49,131
I think...

285
00:14:49,214 --> 00:14:51,311
I think...

286
00:14:51,394 --> 00:14:52,391
I...

287
00:14:52,474 --> 00:14:55,114
I can't!

288
00:15:00,934 --> 00:15:03,214
It's an enemy raid!

289
00:15:03,914 --> 00:15:04,744
I...

290
00:15:04,827 --> 00:15:06,191
You...

291
00:15:06,274 --> 00:15:08,834
You should cherish yourself more!

292
00:15:09,154 --> 00:15:10,814
What are you talking about?

293
00:15:12,834 --> 00:15:15,434
Why is your chest so recklessly exposed?

294
00:15:15,654 --> 00:15:17,183
What if you catch a chill?

295
00:15:23,174 --> 00:15:26,711
Well, I mean, it's not like I want
to dress like this, you weirdo!

296
00:15:26,794 --> 00:15:29,394
Ah, falling out between comrades?

297
00:15:30,314 --> 00:15:33,851
There's only two of them, and
one of them is actually a woman.

298
00:15:33,934 --> 00:15:36,911
Looks like we didn't need to
call everyone out here after all?

299
00:15:36,994 --> 00:15:40,514
But hey, gents, the woman's
quite a looker, isn't she?

300
00:15:40,694 --> 00:15:42,451
Seems she takes care of herself.

301
00:15:42,534 --> 00:15:43,364
We lucked out.

302
00:15:43,634 --> 00:15:45,074
Take the woman alive!

303
00:15:45,354 --> 00:15:46,414
Kill the man!

304
00:15:47,074 --> 00:15:47,904
No!

305
00:15:48,474 --> 00:15:50,434
No little! Take that!

306
00:15:50,754 --> 00:15:53,134
Don't touch my comrades! Take that!

307
00:15:53,754 --> 00:15:57,014
Kinda looks like he's planting
rice paddies. Garnish!

308
00:15:57,574 --> 00:15:58,914
Huh? Be brave!

309
00:15:59,094 --> 00:16:01,871
I have convinced the people of
the village to come to your aid!

310
00:16:01,954 --> 00:16:02,836
It's the chief!

311
00:16:03,834 --> 00:16:04,664
Take that!

312
00:16:04,934 --> 00:16:06,051
It's the chief!

313
00:16:06,134 --> 00:16:08,134
Stay away from Tachibana!

314
00:16:09,074 --> 00:16:09,904
Take a day!

315
00:16:09,987 --> 00:16:12,251
You're acting like a
total weirdo right now!

316
00:16:12,334 --> 00:16:13,434
Are you okay?

317
00:16:14,754 --> 00:16:16,014
Am I? Yes.

318
00:16:16,474 --> 00:16:18,415
It's true, something isn't right.

319
00:16:19,114 --> 00:16:21,834
It's burned into my
eyes, I can't unsee it.

320
00:16:22,294 --> 00:16:24,000
What's burned into your eyes?

321
00:16:25,474 --> 00:16:27,434
It's your... Wait, me?

322
00:16:28,314 --> 00:16:29,234
My what?

323
00:16:29,714 --> 00:16:31,454
Well, it's kinda...

324
00:16:34,674 --> 00:16:36,254
I can't really say.

325
00:16:41,354 --> 00:16:43,594
This is totally my fault.

326
00:16:47,234 --> 00:16:48,694
Just admit it, Jinguji.

327
00:16:49,114 --> 00:16:53,408
If you're being honest, you think I'm
super cute and charming, don't you?

328
00:16:55,374 --> 00:16:56,204
Nope.

329
00:16:56,287 --> 00:16:57,931
I don't think you're cute at all.

330
00:16:58,014 --> 00:16:58,844
Unconvincing.

331
00:16:59,114 --> 00:17:00,414
Jinguji, look up.

332
00:17:02,354 --> 00:17:03,184
Look up?

333
00:17:03,267 --> 00:17:04,914
Wait, what's this? Charmed?

334
00:17:05,834 --> 00:17:06,664
Charmed.

335
00:17:09,594 --> 00:17:14,234
Listen, I know this will sound like an
excuse, but I want you to understand.

336
00:17:14,834 --> 00:17:16,791
I have no interest in young girls.

337
00:17:16,874 --> 00:17:19,151
It's completely outside my preferences.

338
00:17:19,234 --> 00:17:21,474
And blondes really aren't my thing.

339
00:17:21,614 --> 00:17:25,314
But your hair is so soft and
beautiful, and the way it shines,

340
00:17:25,814 --> 00:17:28,414
even at night it illuminates your face.

341
00:17:29,554 --> 00:17:32,434
It's like, since the
change, you are my son.

342
00:17:43,934 --> 00:17:45,351
This is terrifying.

343
00:17:45,434 --> 00:17:47,911
People can't even control their
own thoughts and feelings?

344
00:17:47,994 --> 00:17:50,294
Is this how the charmed effect works?

345
00:17:50,554 --> 00:17:53,191
Seriously, the power of my
looks is way too strong.

346
00:17:53,274 --> 00:17:55,031
This is crazy!

347
00:17:55,114 --> 00:17:59,254
I have to do something before anything
really bad happens. Tachibana.

348
00:18:03,334 --> 00:18:04,374
Sorry, Jinguuji.

349
00:18:04,494 --> 00:18:07,791
I mean, I was in a panic, but I think
I may have slapped you too hard.

350
00:18:07,874 --> 00:18:10,631
No, I have to take some
responsibility for that.

351
00:18:10,714 --> 00:18:11,714
More importantly.

352
00:18:14,454 --> 00:18:15,284
You're better?

353
00:18:16,154 --> 00:18:17,134
I guess so.

354
00:18:23,814 --> 00:18:25,931
You don't have to be so hard on yourself.

355
00:18:26,014 --> 00:18:28,711
I've never experienced a
disgrace of this magnitude!

356
00:18:28,794 --> 00:18:30,031
What a blunder?

357
00:18:30,114 --> 00:18:31,594
Drink up, here!

358
00:18:33,694 --> 00:18:35,971
We really need to come up
with some countermeasures.

359
00:18:36,054 --> 00:18:38,251
I'd rather not get slapped again.

360
00:18:38,334 --> 00:18:40,311
Getting better after being hit!

361
00:18:40,394 --> 00:18:42,431
Man, you're like a broken television.

362
00:18:42,514 --> 00:18:43,914
Shut up!

363
00:18:47,734 --> 00:18:48,854
All right, already.

364
00:18:49,134 --> 00:18:51,171
There's no use crying over spilled milk.

365
00:18:51,254 --> 00:18:53,654
I say we switch gears. Right now.

366
00:18:55,814 --> 00:18:58,167
Let's get drunk on the taste of victory!

367
00:18:59,934 --> 00:19:01,291
Would you just look at this?

368
00:19:01,374 --> 00:19:02,204
It's amazing!

369
00:19:02,314 --> 00:19:04,631
Do you think it might be
the currency of this world?

370
00:19:04,714 --> 00:19:06,771
I don't know, but they've
hoarded quite a lot.

371
00:19:06,854 --> 00:19:09,311
So, what do you think we
should do with this booty?

372
00:19:09,394 --> 00:19:10,871
I think you should have it.

373
00:19:10,954 --> 00:19:13,011
We'd like you to accept
it as our tribute to you.

374
00:19:13,094 --> 00:19:14,374
Please say you will.

375
00:19:14,494 --> 00:19:15,494
Hold on a minute.

376
00:19:15,754 --> 00:19:17,401
I don't need all this stuff.

377
00:19:17,494 --> 00:19:20,906
To be honest, I can't say we
didn't hope for compensation,

378
00:19:21,054 --> 00:19:25,271
but it's pretty clear that all of this
must have been pillaged from this area.

379
00:19:25,354 --> 00:19:26,254
Don't you see?

380
00:19:26,354 --> 00:19:27,931
You're the saviors of our village.

381
00:19:28,014 --> 00:19:30,274
Won't you allow us to repay you? Huh.

382
00:19:30,554 --> 00:19:33,011
When you put it that
way, it's hard to refuse.

383
00:19:33,094 --> 00:19:36,388
Oh, in that case, I've just
thought of something I want.

384
00:19:45,734 --> 00:19:46,734
What'd you think?

385
00:19:46,894 --> 00:19:49,774
It's totally modest and
it fits me like a glove.

386
00:19:50,054 --> 00:19:51,454
Oh, some new clothes.

387
00:19:51,834 --> 00:19:53,334
I suppose it's all right.

388
00:19:56,154 --> 00:19:59,213
Jinguji, you're doing this
to save face, aren't you?

389
00:19:59,494 --> 00:20:02,729
That's part of being vulnerable
to my charms, isn't it?

390
00:20:04,294 --> 00:20:05,191
This guy.

391
00:20:05,274 --> 00:20:10,754
He plays it so cool, but inside he
finds me so cute he can't even stand it.

392
00:20:11,534 --> 00:20:12,874
This is awesome!

393
00:20:13,234 --> 00:20:14,574
It feels so good!

394
00:20:14,954 --> 00:20:19,294
I had no idea being this cute could
make a person feel omnipotent!

395
00:20:23,914 --> 00:20:24,851
Okay, that hurts!

396
00:20:24,934 --> 00:20:25,764
You win!

397
00:20:25,847 --> 00:20:26,677
I give up!

398
00:20:26,760 --> 00:20:27,590
I give up!

399
00:20:27,673 --> 00:20:28,560
What was that supposed to be?

400
00:20:30,994 --> 00:20:34,751
Well, I'm sure it's a bummer knowing
someone's figured out your weakness.

401
00:20:34,834 --> 00:20:38,716
Guess it's a good thing that it's
only me, then, wouldn't you say?

402
00:20:42,134 --> 00:20:44,487
Hey, Hunt, do you smell something weird?

403
00:20:52,174 --> 00:20:53,004
Fire!

404
00:20:55,194 --> 00:20:58,554
Jinguuji, this is bad!
Fire! There's a fire!

405
00:20:58,854 --> 00:20:59,914
Hey, Jinguuji!

406
00:21:00,454 --> 00:21:03,134
Well then, someone's
figured out my weakness.

407
00:21:05,294 --> 00:21:08,000
That's the first time
this has happened to me.

408
00:21:09,574 --> 00:21:10,474
Stop that!

409
00:21:10,674 --> 00:21:13,914
This is not the time to be
basking in your emotions!

410
00:21:23,454 --> 00:21:24,634
Is it morning?

411
00:21:26,354 --> 00:21:27,814
Satayna, are you there?

412
00:21:28,274 --> 00:21:29,414
I'm right here.

413
00:21:35,694 --> 00:21:38,451
As beautiful as ever, lucky me.

414
00:21:38,534 --> 00:21:40,151
Premier um?

415
00:21:40,234 --> 00:21:41,471
Yes, yes.

416
00:21:41,554 --> 00:21:43,171
You're as lovely as ever, right?

417
00:21:43,254 --> 00:21:45,211
I'm tired of hearing that.

418
00:21:45,294 --> 00:21:47,691
Oh no, that isn't well.

419
00:21:47,774 --> 00:21:49,551
Then let's get out there and work.

420
00:21:49,634 --> 00:21:53,954
Premier, we shall work for the sake
of this beautiful elven forest.

421
00:21:59,534 --> 00:22:03,814
It's a TOTALLY BURN TO THE GROUND!

422
00:22:28,934 --> 00:22:30,254
Let's go!

423
00:22:34,954 --> 00:22:37,034
Yeah! Fabulous! Fabulous!

424
00:22:50,634 --> 00:22:53,394
Oh, my God. I'm sure. I'm sure.

425
00:22:54,334 --> 00:22:55,164
Oh, yeah.

426
00:22:58,774 --> 00:23:00,251
Who are you? Who are you?

427
00:23:00,334 --> 00:23:02,254
Prince, you are so cute. My God.

428
00:23:02,414 --> 00:23:03,954
To her, finally stop.

429
00:23:04,174 --> 00:23:06,731
Love like that love, not love.

430
00:23:06,814 --> 00:23:10,811
To who and that love, have not to
be too easy. My God. Who are you?

431
00:23:10,894 --> 00:23:11,794
To you, to you?

432
00:23:12,834 --> 00:23:13,694
How are you?

433
00:23:14,114 --> 00:23:14,944
Bep do you to?

434
00:23:15,027 --> 00:23:16,914
To you.

435
00:23:17,674 --> 00:23:18,751
Wow, you're deep.

436
00:23:18,834 --> 00:23:21,494
A little bit different,
I'm sure you're here?

437
00:23:22,394 --> 00:23:23,224
It's a big deal!

438
00:23:23,307 --> 00:23:25,292
You can't do it, but you can't live.

439
00:23:31,434 --> 00:23:33,294
You're so happy, you and you?

440
00:23:37,314 --> 00:23:38,144
What's wrong?

441
00:23:38,227 --> 00:23:39,231
I saw one in my room!

442
00:23:39,314 --> 00:23:40,851
One of those things that starts with C!

443
00:23:40,934 --> 00:23:44,291
Calm down, open the door, spray
some peppermint oil See, it ran!

444
00:23:44,374 --> 00:23:45,951
The real question is, in this world,

445
00:23:46,034 --> 00:23:48,151
no insects Should we have
released that thing into it?

446
00:23:48,234 --> 00:23:50,754
Destroying an ecosystem is not okay!
